But wait - `zip_source_layered_create` no longer calls `zip_source_keep(src)`. So when `zip_source_decompress` creates a layered source with `D->src = W1`, it doesn't increment W1's refcount. W1's refcount stays at 1 (from `_zip_source_new`).

